<title>CHILE: TelexChile nine-month net falls.</title>
<headline>TelexChile nine-month net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Long-distance telecommunications company TelexChile SA reported the following results in the first nine months of the year.</p>
<p>				 9-mo 1996	 9-mo 1995</p>
<p>Net profit		   6.51     profit  7.16</p>
<p>Operating loss	     0.15     profit  0.64</p>
<p>Non-operting pofit	 6.64     profit  6.58</p>
<p>Total sales		  4.37		15.22</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago Newsroom 562-699-5595x212</p>
</text>
